  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"archive-header\">\n\n\t<h1 class=\"archive-title\">Marion Harcourt</h1>\n\n\t\n\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-5705 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-news tag-marion-harcourt\" id=\"post-5705\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/sally-brown-a-cape-cod-mermaid/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"350\" height=\"500\" alt=\"Sally brown a cape cod mermaid by marion belle harcourt.\" src=\"/media/archive/47edac17e45135dde095dbd17270c424f4acc4fdffdef545634744f5fe46cfc9.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/sally-brown-a-cape-cod-mermaid/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Sally Brown, A Cape Cod Mermaid</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2021-03-09T08:00:59-05:00\" title=\"Tuesday, March 9, 2021, 8:00 am\">March 9, 2021</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Sally Brown, A Cape Cod Mermaid Why are Cape Cod Mermaids the only mermaids in the world to have a bellybutton in the shape of a heart? Could it be <a href=\"/news/sally-brown-a-cape-cod-mermaid/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder has-excerpt post-4095 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-gallery-artists category-news tag-cape-cod-artist tag-chatham tag-marion-harcourt\" id=\"post-4095\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/marion-harcourt-to-exhibit/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"282\" height=\"220\" alt=\"A painting of a man on a canoe near a bridge.\" src=\"/media/archive/229a0b15da7c594d4474f6370e3c4e139b6adccc2d5d47b47c1195328e86d705.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/marion-harcourt-to-exhibit/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Marion Harcourt to Exhibit</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2019-01-05T16:22:42-05:00\" title=\"Saturday, January 5, 2019, 4:22 pm\">January 5, 2019</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Guild Member, Marion Harcourt  is having a reception of 25 paintings, notecards, placemats, and some prints on Sunday, January 6 at 2:00 pm at the Unitarian Universalist Meetinghouse, 819 Main St., Chatham.﻿ #ArtAndCommunity #Chatham #CapeCod</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3920 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-education category-meet-the-artist category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news tag-cape-cod-art-galleries tag-carl-wood tag-marion-harcourt tag-meet-the-artist\" id=\"post-3920\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/july-21-meet-the-artists/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"691\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A watercolor painting of a river and marsh.\" src=\"/media/archive/d0b140abf08b684eb199eddf1625d89bb3abbb01999070733440f434e5522e1a.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/july-21-meet-the-artists/\" rel=\"bookmark\">July 21 Meet The Artists</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-07-10T11:32:41-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, July 10, 2018, 11:32 am\">July 10, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Meet the Artists Marion Harcourt and Carl Wood for a free demonstration at the Art Gallery of the Guild of Harwich Artists from 2 to 4 PM on Saturday, July 21.  Marion will <a href=\"/news/july-21-meet-the-artists/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3298 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-education category-events category-meet-the-artist category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news tag-kathy-elkamouny tag-marion-harcourt tag-meet-the-artist tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3298\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/meet-the-artists/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"375\" height=\"500\" alt=\"Marion Harcourt demonstrating at Meet The Artist, ©Guild of Harwich Artists\" src=\"/media/archive/45d800daa98897611051859a7dff7d75e79e3359759ffd4cd2a92865bb23198f.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/meet-the-artists/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Meet The Artists</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2017-08-06T17:02:08-04:00\" title=\"Sunday, August 6, 2017, 5:02 pm\">August 6, 2017</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Busy Saturday in Harwich Port for Meet The Artists featuring Marion Harcourt and Kathy ElKamouny  The Art Gallery of The Guild of Harwich Artists, 551 Main Street (Route 28), Harwich <a href=\"/news/meet-the-artists/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3253 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-education category-events category-meet-the-artist category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news tag-kathy-elkamouny tag-marion-harcourt tag-meet-the-artist tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3253\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/august-5-meet-the-artists/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"639\" height=\"500\" alt=\"©Marion Harcourt, North Truro Sand Dune\" src=\"/media/archive/144190801ea0954fc661c14ed2a7098c161222ccea8c8b27f2eeb67e2d78bf75.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/august-5-meet-the-artists/\" rel=\"bookmark\">August 5 Meet The Artists</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2017-07-30T16:50:55-04:00\" title=\"Sunday, July 30, 2017, 4:50 pm\">July 30, 2017</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Meet The Artists Marion Harcourt and Kathy ElKamouny at a free demonstration Saturday, August 5 from 2 to 4 pm at The Art Gallery of the Guild of Harwich Artists <a href=\"/news/august-5-meet-the-artists/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n",
